flowchart LR
    D[Causal strategy decision] --> R[Immutable CanonicalOrderRequest]
    C[ResolvedExecutionContext] --> R
    R --> A1[Attempt 1 requested]
    A1 --> V[validated]
    V --> AC[accepted]
    AC --> O[open]
    AC --> F[filled]
    O --> PF[partially filled]
    PF --> F
    O --> X[canceled or expired or rejected]
    PF --> X
    O --> RP[replaced]
    PF --> RP
    RP --> A2[Replacement attempt for exact residual]
    A2 --> V2[validated and accepted]
    V2 --> F

    PF --> CF[Canonical fill input]
    F --> CF
    CF --> ACC[Existing position wallet fee and PnL owners]
    ACC --> EV[Runtime event ledger]
    EV --> BL[BotLens projection]
    EV --> RR[RunResearchDataset projection]

    VP[Venue lifecycle mapping] -. terminology only .-> A1
    L2[L2 walking queue and latency] -. separate capability .-> A1
    LIVE[External submission] -. prohibited by ADR 0049 .-> A1
